+    ``slim.learning.create_train_op`` becomes ``train_eager.make_train_step``,
+    the ``FIFOQueue`` plus its thread and ``Coordinator`` become
+    ``train_eager.make_dataset``, and the TF1 ``Saver`` becomes
+    ``train_eager.SnapshotSaver``.  Those helpers are shared with
